@ 34.4 - Proto-Quechumaran to Huarás
# citation: Pogostick Man, from Orr, Carolyn, and Robert E. Longacre (1968), “Proto-Quechumaran”. Language 44(3):528 – 555
	pʼ tʼ tʃʼ kʼ qʼ → p t ts k q
	h → ∅ / p_
	tʰ → t
	q → q͡χ
	ts(h) tʃ → tʃ ts
	tʃ → ts / _q
	ʈʂ → s / _K
	ʈʂ → tʃ / _V
	ɸ(ʼ,ʰ) → p
	ʂ → ʃ / _a
	ʂ → h / _{i,u}
	ɲ → n
	aw aj {uj,ij} → uː eː iː